  "solution": "Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tổng khoảng cách <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>F</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>50</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>25</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1875</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy elip có phương trình <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2500</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>y</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>1875</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<div class=\"paragraph-gap\"></div>",
